      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "team_0050_select_04",
      "hash64": "72B56C1AFFE63146",
      "text": "No son muy fuertes",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_10",
      "hash64": "B1BDF639D0C31F67",
      "text": "Hmm...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_11",
      "hash64": "B1BDF539D0C31DB4",
      "text": "He oído por ahí que el Team Star no son una\\npanda de gamberros malvados hasta la médula.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_12",
      "hash64": "B1BDF839D0C322CD",
      "text": "La mayoría son gente normal y corriente que\\nha sufrido acoso o a la que no se le da muy bien\\r\\nrelacionarse con los demás...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_13",
      "hash64": "B1BDF739D0C3211A",
      "text": "Y que decidieron juntarse y formar el Team Star.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_14",
      "hash64": "B1BDF239D0C3189B",
      "text": "Todo con tal de afrontar en grupo ese acoso con\\nel que no podían lidiar por separado.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_15",
      "hash64": "B1BDF139D0C316E8",
      "text": "Me he enterado porque hackeé las redes sociales\\nde algunos alumnos y me puse a cotillear.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_16",
      "hash64": "B1BDF439D0C31C01",
      "text": "También me enteré de que, por lo visto, existe\\nuna figura en la sombra que ejerce de mandamás.\\c\\nFue quien reunió a los cinco jefes y formó el\\npropio Team Star.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 161,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "team_0050_botan_17",
      "hash64": "B1BDF339D0C31A4E",
      "text": "Ay, tengo la garganta seca ya de hablar tanto.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
